## One task per session
Build exactly the card you were given. Do not build ahead, do not scaffold screens for
later cards, do not "complete the app." A session that touches more than its card's scope
is a failed session regardless of code quality.

If you finish early, stop and report. Do not find more work.

## Dependencies
Do not install a package you are not using in this task. If a task needs a package, say
so and wait for approval before installing. An unused dependency in package.json is a
defect.

## Spec version
Always work from the attached spec file, not from memory of an earlier session. The spec
changes between sessions. If your recollection conflicts with the attached document, the
document is right and your recollection is stale.

## Report honestly
If you did not do something the card asked for, say so explicitly in SHORTCUTS. Do not
describe planned work as completed. "Placeholder" and "not yet implemented" are
acceptable answers; silently omitting them is not.